	"GREY2_E"Level 1 "PINK_E"(Permanent = €5) "RED_E"|| "PINK_E"(Temporary = €2 per month):\n\
	"YELLOW_E"1) "WHITE_E"Special Rank on forums and ability to change your "LB_E"[ID] "WHITE_E"color in chat.\n");
